<title>INDONESIA: Indocement Bogasari proceeds for Indofood.</title>
<headline>Indocement Bogasari proceeds for Indofood.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's cement giant PT Indocement Tunggal Prakarsa said on Tuesday it planned to use proceeds from the sale of its Bogasari Flour Mill to subscribe to an expected rights issue by its subsidiary PT Indofood Sukses Makmur.</p>
<p>&quot;Indocement is now ready with the cash to pay for it (the subscription). We don't need to look for other funds to finance it. We've funds from the proceeds from the Bogasari sale to finance the purchase,&quot; Subrata told Reuters.</p>
<p>Indocement sold its Bogasari Flour Mill for 1.86 trillion rupiah to Indofood last June.</p>
</text>
